      "content": "I suggest a proactive strategy to control the narrative as quickly as possible. Prepare a carefully crafted statement that addresses the leak, perhaps framing the \"vote against funding\" as a strategic fiscal concern rather than a personal rejection of the center. This should be delivered consistently and confidently to all press to minimize speculative coverage.",
